  Dialogue:
  - Time: 0
    Dialogue:
    - Text: '[patterns="1,2,4,5,6"][auto="0"]'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
  - Time: 129
    Dialogue:
    - Text: '[s="gloria"][patterns="0"]Oh look at that!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]You are still managing to stand on your own two feet after
        the first act!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]I have to admit I was expecting you to take your final bow
        of the performance by now'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]Not that I thought you were incapable or anything, I simply
        didn\u2019t realize we had such a fighter amongst us!!"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]A true survivor\u2026"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]A persistent little RISING STAR on our hands tonight!!!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]Tell me DARLING\u2026"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]Are you enjoying the show tonight?'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"you\"]\u2026"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]OH!! Don\u2019t be shy We have had such a lovely time
        together with all that jumping, dodging, and stumbling all about the stage"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]AND Isn\u2019t it just PRECIOUS that you have started
        to get the hang of it?"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]but\u2026 PERSONALLY DARLING\u2026"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]I must admit this is all a little too choreographed for
        my taste'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]I was hoping for a little more FLAIR; A little more PASSION;
        I was hoping for some real IMPROVISATION on stage here tonight!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]and every great performer and every great performance
        of theirs comes with a little adversity and hardship, isn\u2019t that right
        darling?"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]After all, how could I possibly be a star without someone
        to dance around on stage?'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"][patterns="1,2,4,5,6"]PLACES AGAIN EVERYONE!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
  - Time: 273
    Dialogue:
    - Text: '[s="gloria"][patterns="0"]A STAR IS BORN!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]BRAVO!!! BRAVISSIMO!!! WHAT A PERFORMANCE!!! WHAT A SPECTACLE!!!
        SOMEBODY GET THIS STAR A BOQUET! SOME FLOWERS FOR THEIR PERFORMANCE!!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]We have laughed! We have cried! We have danced and we have
        dodged! '
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]and you my rising star, have made it all the way to the
        end!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"][patterns=\"0\"]Don\u2019t let it all go to your head,
        Streisand"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]There\u2019s only room for ONE HEADLINER around here!"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]OHHOHOHO HAHAHA'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]Maybe I should start mixing stand up comedy into my future
        performances'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]Do you think I have a knack for it, darling?'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"you\"]\u2026"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"]Well!! It seems like we have a tough crowd tonight folks!'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: "[s=\"gloria\"]I suppose it\u2019s time for our final bow now,"
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
    - Text: '[s="gloria"][patterns="1,2,4,5,6"]Shall we?'
      Audio: {fileID: 0}
